<div class="side-by-side">
  <p class="big">The Scene</p>
  <p>
    Coverage of the music community that keeps the region loud. At Crucial
    Times Fest, Spokane's hardcore scene raised more than $2,000 for local
    groups helping immigrants and refugees. Alongside it runs a series of
    artist interviews with It's A Setup, A Quiet Life, Jumbotron and
    Pannonica, finished with hand-drawn titles that match each band.
  </p>
</div>

