<h2>The Impact</h2>

<p>
  Good Loser gives a camera and a careful edit to stories that usually go
  untold in Eastern Washington. It reaches English- and Spanish-speaking
  audiences in the same release, and gives organizers, artists and candidates
  a film they can share and build on long after the event is over.
</p>

